@leandown/typst.ts

This package contains a WebAssembly build of typst.ts
(https://github.com/Myriad-Dreamin/typst.ts, Apache License 2.0), version
v0.8.0-rc3, modified by the leandown authors: the patches in `patches/` add a
bundle export (Typst's multi-file HTML output) to the web compiler.

typst.ts embeds Typst (https://github.com/typst/typst, Apache License 2.0).
